offspring_pairs.description:
The map of entity to offspring definitions that this entity can make offspring with.

Sample values:
• chicken: {"minecraft:chicken":"minecraft:chicken"}
• cow: {"minecraft:cow":"minecraft:cow"}
• dolphin: {"minecraft:dolphin":"minecraft:dolphin"}

property_inheritance.description:
List of Entity Properties that should be inherited from the parent entities and potentially mutated.

Sample values:
• chicken: {"minecraft:climate_variant":{}}
